Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:39.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,和我不一樣…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:42.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那漂亮又柔順的長髮\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:45.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看起來閃閃發亮…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:58.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好久不見\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:02.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我美麗的黑羽鳥啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:06.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,竟然特地來到這種地方…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:10.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我親愛的白羽\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:15.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那光澤動人的嘴唇！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:18.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還有那柔美的指尖！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.32,0:01:19.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,以及\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.37,0:01:22.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,比夜色還要美麗的黑髮！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.95,0:01:25.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為了見你一面特地遠道而來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:26.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,實在太值得了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:29.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,您還是那麼會說話呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:31.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙是誰啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.30,0:01:33.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那位是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:35.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,雅納戈的市長\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.30,0:01:36.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,市長？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:39.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那他來這裡幹嘛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:41.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他是薇洛妮卡大人的金…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.31,0:01:46.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是我們店裡的大客戶\n堅持一定要見您\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:48.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還特地用假期跑來這裡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:53.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,比起那個… 我聽說了喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:56.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,身為夜之女王的你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:01:59.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然在學人當冒險者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:00.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,夜之…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.45,0:02:01.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,女王？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.37,0:02:05.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼要做那麼危險的事？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:07.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果缺錢的話\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:08.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:10.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝您的關心 市長\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:15.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過來我店裡休息的客人之中\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:17.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也有很多冒險者…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.09,0:02:21.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為了能更深地撫慰他們\n我太渴求能帶來更多慰藉的“某樣東西”…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:24.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就不知不覺\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:27.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把腳步走向了冒險…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:28.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,女…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.64,0:02:31.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,女神啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:33.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你實在太溫柔了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:34.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢噢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.07,0:02:40.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,薇洛妮卡你的溫柔\n都滲到我的五臟六腑裡了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.13,0:03:03.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:14.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第10話 剪髮與選擇）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:17.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在雅納戈等你喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:20.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,薇洛妮卡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:24.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:27.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,塔妮婭也是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:29.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,薇洛妮卡大人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:32.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,您還會在這個村子待多久呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.68,0:04:36.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這個呢… 待太久也不太好…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.65,0:04:39.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,畢竟衝著我來的客人也很多吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:40.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:43.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過沒有問題的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:47.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被您拯救的人們\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:50.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,包含我在內 在店裡有很多呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:53.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,店由我們來打理就好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:55.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,您想怎麼做都可以\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.29,0:05:00.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是嫌我礙事想趕我走吧…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:03.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不… 那個…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:06.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,其… 其實我希望您能回來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:10.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,騙你的啦 謝謝\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:26.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好厲害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:28.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,亮晶晶的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:33.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那大叔出手真闊綽\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:35.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想要的話我可以給你喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.71,0:05:36.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,才不要\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:41.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要怎麼做才能像姊姊一樣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:43.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把男人玩弄在掌心呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:45.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在說什麼啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.43,0:05:50.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你也變得跟我一樣是個好女人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:51.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也能做到喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:55.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也要當好女人！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:58.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就先從像我一樣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:05:59.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把頭髮留長開始吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:03.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露的髮色很漂亮 剪短太可惜了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.19,0:06:05.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,頭髮可是女人的命\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:09.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮的頭髮是好女人的必備條件\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:14.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是莉露是冒險者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:16.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要方便活動才好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:21.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,冒險者哪有空天天顧頭髮啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.67,0:06:24.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是嫌麻煩而已吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.13,0:06:27.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:28.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,幹嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:29.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:31.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,頭髮變長了呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:33.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:36.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在變得更難看之前我幫你剪掉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:37.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:39.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,現在？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:41.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你反正也很閒吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:51.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要剪什麼髮型呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.45,0:06:55.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我還沒回答你咧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.41,0:06:57.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,開玩笑的啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:06:59.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,照老樣子就行了吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:02.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我會認真剪 放心吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.05,0:07:11.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很熟練吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:13.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也來幫忙吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:15.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,給我乖乖待著！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.31,0:07:16.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嘖…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:19.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露明明也會剪得很好的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.81,0:07:24.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想想 我們也認識很久了呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.07,0:07:29.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到你竟然會升到白銀等級\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:32.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,彼此彼此吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:33.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,夜之女王啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.33,0:07:44.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我啊 總有一天要成為\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:46.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很適合亮晶晶長髮的夜之女王！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:49.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就要變成超強冒險者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:52.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,每天都吃到飽！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:08:00.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,話說你連市長都能玩弄在掌心…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.35,0:08:04.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到我還追到這種地方來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:07.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你待太久了啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:12.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快回去快回去\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:16.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你亂動會刺到喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:18.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是已經刺到了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:20.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:28.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:30.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,結束了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:31.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:34.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剪好了 始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:37.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,睡著了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:41.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.39,0:08:44.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我去散個步好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:46.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也要來嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:49.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露要在這裡等始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:50.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:53.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,工具就讓莉露幫你收起來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:56.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那真是幫大忙了 那就拜託你啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.28,0:08:59.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,路上小心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.29,0:09:08.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也能把始變得很帥的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:40.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被您拯救的人們\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:43.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,包含我在內 在店裡有很多呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:57.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,回去吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:10:01.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想繼續當冒險者的話 頭髮也太長了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:07.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！既然決定了就趕快收拾回程吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:14.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這可怎麼辦？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:17.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 各位大叔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.65,0:10:19.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,薇洛妮卡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:20.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:23.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,倉庫裡跑出蜘蛛了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:24.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.95,0:10:27.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛而已 有什麼好大驚小怪的？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.33,0:10:30.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我去幫你們除掉！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:32.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是蜘蛛沒錯但…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:36.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:55.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:06.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:08.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,請問東雲先生在嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.87,0:11:11.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始在睡覺\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:13.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,安靜一點！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:14.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.09,0:11:16.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是事態緊急\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.01,0:11:17.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我醒著\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.51,0:11:23.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.51,0:11:24.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,東雲先生！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.51,0:11:25.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:28.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,薇洛妮卡小姐被蜘蛛抓走了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:34.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,換… 換造型嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.02,0:11:36.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在說什麼？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:45.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,東雲先生被剃得光溜溜的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:48.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底怎麼了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:50.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 始… 噗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:52.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我嚇到了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.25,0:11:55.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什麼啊 到底哪裡…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:10.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,難怪覺得頭特別輕…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:13.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:15.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她去哪了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:18.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她… 她說要去散步…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:24.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,薇洛妮卡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.53,0:12:27.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大鷹跳蛛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:29.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,抓到獵物之後\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:32.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有會先放著不管 等獵物虛弱的習性\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.83,0:12:35.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是從這個洞鑽進來的嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:37.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姊姊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.09,0:12:39.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是薇洛妮卡大人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:41.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要沒有受重傷\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:43.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我想應該沒問題…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:47.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,都怪我沉迷於製作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:49.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,“被揍很爽的魔物排行榜”…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:54.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思啊 始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:57.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們光是逃命就已經拼盡全力…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.81,0:13:00.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒事 這本來就是冒險者的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:01.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:06.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,薇洛妮卡大人就拜託你了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.62,0:13:09.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.74,0:13:12.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,救回來之後我還要揍她一頓\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:15.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒事嗎 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:18.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露沒問題的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.35,0:13:33.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,果然…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:51.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,巢的擴張範圍還真大\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.99,0:13:53.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,連蚯蚓鼴鼠都不想靠近\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.95,0:13:56.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,得小心別被牠們撞飛…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:00.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這裡分兩路搜索吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:02.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那邊交給你！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:03.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:05.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:08.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個蠢貨到底跑哪去了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:22.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,連鹿都被當成食物嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:26.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,竟然連這麼大的生物也…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:29.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姊姊沒事吧…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:31.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,唉…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:38.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,薇洛妮卡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:40.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.83,0:14:42.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在的話給我回一聲！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:46.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,找到你我要宰了你！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:50.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:52.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你那麼大聲會把魔獸引來！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.02,0:14:59.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,失策失策\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:03.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,算了 先這樣把蜘蛛減少的話…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:07.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那蠢貨多少也會安全點吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.82,0:15:13.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,上吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:27.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就算沒頭髮 始還是始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:28.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:32.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,蚯蚓鼴鼠！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.89,0:15:34.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:37.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別管我！去找薇洛妮卡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:45.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:50.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,交給我吧 始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:52.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露一定會找到的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:07.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姊姊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.21,0:16:10.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不在嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.30,0:16:14.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姊姊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:16.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有人嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:20.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剛才那個聲音是！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:29.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,聲音是從這邊傳來的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:38.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姊姊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:41.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 你來救我了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:44.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一起回去吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.79,0:16:45.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不可以過來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:50.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我回不去\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:52.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:54.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:16:57.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我已經… 動不了了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:16:59.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.93,0:17:02.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒問題！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.98,0:17:05.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們會想辦法的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:07.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好痛 別拉我啦 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.77,0:17:11.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你受傷了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:13.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:18.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姊姊由莉露來保護！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.17,0:17:25.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:59.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,頭髮是女人的命\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:03.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮的頭髮是好女人的必備條件\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:13.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我美麗的黑羽鳥啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:18.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.65,0:18:36.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姊姊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:44.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,危險！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.55,0:18:58.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:00.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,關鍵時刻就這麼不可靠…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:01.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙真是的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:18.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,誰說我不可靠？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:23.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.49,0:19:25.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你哪位？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:33.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你這腦袋是怎麼回事啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:34.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想怎樣！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:36.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你笑什麼！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:37.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是你搞的吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:38.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啥？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:40.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我有好好幫你剪啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.55,0:19:41.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,騙人！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:43.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我沒騙人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:48.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個… 莉露覺得\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.85,0:19:51.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始這樣也很帥…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:07.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原來是你！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.13,0:20:20.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:23.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我以為可以剪得更帥…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.55,0:20:26.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,光頭也很適合你喔…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:35.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你要笑到什麼時候？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:36.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快回去了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:45.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,短髮也很適合您\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.62,0:20:46.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:48.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:49.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.95,0:20:52.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-小心腳下\n-就算光溜溜也很帥\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.37,0:20:54.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露是這麼覺得\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.29,0:20:55.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本沒在反省吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.79,0:20:57.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我有反省…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:20:59.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我不吃晚餐也可以…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:02.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那種事誰管你啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:08.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她的頭髮真的很漂亮\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:12.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果能像那樣漂亮\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:16.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果能那樣閃閃發亮\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:17.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.77,0:21:21.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也能像她那樣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:25.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笑得那麼幸福嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:28.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:31.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我把莉露的頭髮送你當賠禮…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:34.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就說不要了！真是的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.54,0:21:37.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍也願意為始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:38.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,分點毛給你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:41.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別了吧…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.46,0:21:45.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,當椅子的那位也可以分頭髮給始嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:46.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是能讓薇洛妮卡大人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:48.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,替我剃髮的話\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.80,0:21:50.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常樂意！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:54.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:56.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你很會剃頭髮嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:22:00.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我頭髮也變短了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:02.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那我暫時也在這邊當冒險者吧\n請多指教\n
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:04.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,滾回去啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:40.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下回 魅惑的力量）\n
